   "text": "How do I answer an Edexcel IGCSE Business 'Define' question?"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- In these questions you need to provide a** clear meaning** of a given business term\n\n  - You will **not** receive any marks for giving examples"
  },
